       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SPHEROID-ALU-LISSAJOUS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SPHEROID-ALU-PROOFS.
           05  WS-QUATERNION-PHASE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EDO22-TUNING-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DISPLACEMENT-SYNC-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ALU-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPHEROID-ALU-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SPHEROID-ALU-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-ALU-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-ALU-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PHASE-AND-TUNING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DISPLACE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-ALU-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PHASE-AND-TUNING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QUATERNION-PHASE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EDO22-TUNING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DISPLACE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DISPLACEMENT-SYNC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALU-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-ALU-PROOFS.
           IF WS-QUATERNION-PHASE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-EDO22-TUNING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DISPLACEMENT-SYNC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ALU-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SPHEROID-ALU-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-ALU-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-ALU-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-ALU-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-ALU-CODE.
